This repository contains the details of my internship at The University of Tokyo in collaboration with the Japan Atomic Energy Agency, on the μSPLIT project. 

It is organized as:
-> Rapport_de_Stage_Master_Thesis.pdf : The complete report of the internship.
-> Defense__Pierre-ROGER_s_internship.pdf : The support for the defense of the internship realized in Polytech Nancy.
-> Python : Folder containing the different files used for the automatized workflow.
-> OpenFOAM : Folder containing the template used for the CFD simulations.
